1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,720
Every morning,

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:01,840
he wins.

3
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,800
He doesn't look like an enemy.

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,380
He looks like you.

5
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,460
He says,

6
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:07,840
five more minutes.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:08,900
He says,

8
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:09,980
start Monday.

9
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:11,120
He says,

10
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,620
you've earned a rest.

11
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,500
And every time you listen,

12
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,060
he gets stronger.

13
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,300
One snooze becomes a week.

14
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,300
A week becomes a year.

15
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:21,760
So tomorrow,

16
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,060
when that alarm goes off...

17
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:24,780
Don't negotiate.

18
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:25,880
Don't think.

19
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,160
Get up first.

20
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,740
Because if you don't...

